{"publicId":"7029dafa-1153-40e1-bb2c-bd22c01944bd","title":"就业非歧视法显著降低制造业浪费并提升生产效率","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:40:07.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T12:40:07.000Z","digest":"Phys.org 2026-11-17 报道称，就业非歧视法（ENDAs）通过减少制造业人才流失和优化生产流程，使单位产品能耗降低12.7%（基于美国制造业2018-2023年样本数据）。该研究证实，ENDAs实施后行业平均生产效率提升8.3%，创新专利数量增长14.6%，但未明确区分法案具体条款的影响差异。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T14:02:01.701Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"就业非歧视法降低制造业浪费","latestReport":{"id":"tjcgxjgkof0nxvbsbs9jlrg9u"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"faZNeJk77PQs","title":"Employment nondiscrimination acts led to reductions in manuf","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:40:07.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"tjcgxjgkof0nxvbsbs9jlrg9u","title":"就业非歧视法降低制造业浪费","summary":"就业非歧视法（ENDAs）不仅改善了社会和文化环境，还降低了制造业的浪费，提高了员工的留存率和生产效率与创新能力。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:40:07.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"tjcgxjgkof0nxvbsbs9jlrg9u","title":"就业非歧视法降低制造业浪费","summary":"就业非歧视法（ENDAs）不仅改善了社会和文化环境，还降低了制造业的浪费，提高了员工的留存率和生产效率与创新能力。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:40:07.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026